> Er? What is BIhI and why do those words ("to die" and "computer program"?)
> qualify as them?

BIhI is the selma'o for conjunctions meaning "between": {bi'i}, {bi'o}, 
{mi'i}. I grepped the IRC log and found no occurrences of BIhI, but I did 
find words with their rafsi homonyms.

